#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:5
#: 637ca36687324122886a426dfd0c92b5
msgid "Plane SITL/MAVProxy Tutorial"
msgstr "Plane SITL/MAVProxy 教程"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:7
#: 617db04eb8aa4b34acf7d4888c658943
msgid ""
"This tutorial provides a basic walk-through of how to use :ref:`SITL <sitl-"
"simulator-software-in-the-loop>` and :ref:`MAVProxy<mavproxy:home>` for "
"*Plane* testing."
msgstr ""
"本教程提供了如何使用 :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` 和 "
":ref:`MAVProxy<mavproxy:home>` 进行 *Plane* 测试的基本操作指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:12
#: d1c2a6430df74b91a9e9a9060cdc6cfe
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:14
#: 34800f7a7c034f0390b125d7bc3314a2
msgid ""
"The article is intended primarily for developers who want to test new Plane "
"builds and bug fixes using SITL and *MAVProxy*. It shows how to take off, "
"run missions, fly in ``GUIDED`` mode, set a geofence, and perform a number "
"of other basic testing tasks."
msgstr ""
"本文主要面向希望使用 SITL 和 *MAVProxy* 测试新 Plane 构建版本及修复 bug 的开发者。文中展示了如何起飞、执行任务、在 "
"``GUIDED`` 模式下飞行、设置地理围栏以及执行其他基本测试任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:19
#: b53d0f28bba940a4a8f8e3af229cb7c4
msgid ""
"The tutorial is complementary to the topic :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot "
"Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`."
msgstr ""
"本教程是 :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` 主题的补充内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:23
#: b7a3dad4964d447db341856d250bfa8f
msgid ""
"We use *MAVProxy* here, but you can :ref:`attach another ground station to "
"SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>` if you prefer (similar "
"instructions can be used in any GCS)."
msgstr ""
"本文使用 *MAVProxy*，但您也可以 :ref:`将其他地面站连接到 SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing_connecting_otheradditional_ground_stations>`（类似操作步骤适用于任何 GCS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:25
#: 35da091d0103440f96ef04b7bd3fa355
msgid ""
"This tutorial is for Plane - see :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-"
"tutorial>` and :ref:`Rover <rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` for similar "
"tutorials on the other vehicles."
msgstr ""
"本教程适用于 Plane——有关其他机型的类似教程，请参阅 :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` "
"和 :ref:`Rover <rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:30
#: 85722581bc56467d817767c9c591b1ac
msgid "Preconditions"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:32
#: caecc6a8a3f14f3092dbee0d03264118
msgid ""
"The tutorial assumes you have already set up :ref:`SITL on Windows <sitl-"
"native-on-windows>` or :ref:`Linux <setting-up-sitl-on-linux>` and that you "
"have started SITL using the ``--map`` and ``--console`` options:"
msgstr ""
"本教程假设您已在 :ref:`Windows <sitl-native-on-windows>` 或 :ref:`Linux <setting-up-"
"sitl-on-linux>` 上配置好 SITL，并使用 ``--map`` 和 ``--console`` 选项启动了 SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:43
#: d5197d4448a142c7ab5bbf265c08ca88
msgid ""
"If you wish to start the simulation at a different map location or use a "
"different frame type (-f option for quadplane,firefly,etc.) than a standard "
"aileron/elevator/rudder/throttle plane, see :ref:`SITL Advance Testing "
"<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`. A complete list of startup options for "
"the simulator can be found using the --help option:"
msgstr ""
"如果您希望在不同地图位置启动仿真，或使用不同于标准副翼/升降舵/方向舵/油门固定翼的机架类型（使用 -f 选项指定 quadplane、firefly "
"等），请参阅 :ref:`SITL 高级测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`。仿真器的完整启动选项列表可使用 "
"--help 选项查看："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:53
#: 726c8129465643d3b241428411eb0cbf
msgid ""
"The *MAVProxy Command Prompt*, *Console* and *Map* should be arranged "
"conveniently so you can observe the status and send commands at the same "
"time."
msgstr "*MAVProxy 命令提示符*、*控制台* 和 *地图* 应合理排列，以便同时观察状态并发送命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:61
#: dcd8af05a8d548fbab314ea04705d7ce
msgid "Taking off"
msgstr "起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:63
#: e9ed775f0918445bb4e8b64d9bd11189
msgid ""
"To take off with Plane you can use a mission (AUTO mode) that contains the "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF <plane:mav_cmd_nav_takeoff>` command, or use the "
"TAKEOFF mode. If it's a quadplane, you can also takeoff in a VTOL mode such "
"as QLOITER, QHOVER, or QSTABILIZE, by raising the throttle above mid-stick "
"(using normal defaults, RC 3 1600 command for example). Once you are "
"airborne you can switch to other :ref:`flight modes <plane:flight-modes>` "
"(be sure your throttle is set at an appropriate value for that mode)."
msgstr ""
"Plane 起飞可使用包含 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_TAKEOFF <plane:mav_cmd_nav_takeoff>` "
"命令的任务（AUTO 模式），也可使用 TAKEOFF 模式。若为四旋翼固定翼（quadplane），还可在 QLOITER、QHOVER 或 "
"QSTABILIZE 等垂直起降模式下通过将油门推过中间位置来起飞（使用默认设置，例如 RC 3 1600 命令）。起飞后可切换至其他 "
":ref:`飞行模式 <plane:flight-modes>`（请确保油门设置在该模式的适当值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:69
#: d7bfcb45822b46cba6f3f4607dffd25f
msgid ""
"First load the **CMAC-circuit.txt** test mission using the ``wp load`` "
"command as shown below (this mission contains the takeoff command):"
msgstr "首先使用 ``wp load`` 命令加载 **CMAC-circuit.txt** 测试任务（如下所示），该任务包含起飞命令："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:77
#: 62d676631bd14a9985024eb43e54f62f
msgid ""
"Once the mission is loaded you can take off by arming the throttle and "
"setting the mode to ``AUTO`` (the order of these operations does not "
"matter):"
msgstr "任务加载完成后，可通过解锁油门并将模式设置为 ``AUTO`` 来起飞（这两步操作的顺序不影响结果）："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:86
#: 7cf73d19ab154817a9594e168a3b2867
msgid ""
"The plane should take off to an altitude of 40 metres and then proceed "
"through the other mission waypoints (most of which have an altitude of "
"100m). You can stop/pause the mission at any time by changing the mode."
msgstr "飞机应起飞至 40 米高度，然后依次飞越其余任务航点（大多数航点高度为 100 米）。可随时通过更改模式来停止/暂停任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:91
#: d50418012b554674b5846baf819eaa12
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:93
#: c24d8a44544446d3b7a358bc3a6a6726
msgid ""
"During takeoff you can watch the altitude increase on the console in the "
"*Alt* field."
msgstr "起飞过程中，可在控制台的 *Alt* 字段中观察高度的增加情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:96
#: 4770cca50173498a91da74365972e457
msgid ""
"Developers may find it useful to **graph** the takeoff by first entering the"
" ``gtakeoff`` command."
msgstr "开发者可先输入 ``gtakeoff`` 命令，以图表方式查看起飞过程，这可能会很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:102
#: 43bcd3f1b0d944dc9136d5f27095d740
msgid "MAVProxy: PlaneTakeoff Graph (gtakeoff)"
msgstr "MAVProxy：Plane 起飞图表（gtakeoff）"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:105
#: 5f88eb7032c347f3bcc5adf886f07e90
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:107
#: 94a9821186c14eafb934cdb08e573a24
msgid "The most common sources of difficulty taking off are:"
msgstr "起飞困难最常见的原因如下："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:109
#: 422b9a565bba431ea97edbd8833ec291
msgid "Using a mission that does not contain a takeoff command!"
msgstr "使用了不包含起飞命令的任务！"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:110
#: 0f2b1d06845d4ed686d221045cd8bd02
msgid ""
"Attempting to takeoff when the vehicle is not armed. This can happen if the "
"vehicle fails pre-arm checks."
msgstr "在飞行器未解锁时尝试起飞。若飞行器未通过预解锁检查，则可能出现此情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:113
#: 9cd81b605d58423483f3d56e1aae3440
msgid "You can list all *enabled* checks using the command ``arm list``:"
msgstr "可使用 ``arm list`` 命令列出所有*已启用*的检查项："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:128
#: fe1d3ca9d62d4f07942b83430ced87a8
msgid ""
"You can enable and disable checks using ``arm check n`` and ``arm uncheck "
"n`` respectively, where n is the name of the check. Use ``n`` value of "
"``all`` to enables/disable all checks."
msgstr ""
"可分别使用 ``arm check n`` 和 ``arm uncheck n`` 启用和禁用检查项，其中 n 是检查项的名称。将 ``n`` 设为 "
"``all`` 可启用/禁用所有检查项。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:133
#: 08d44c3c867040eca72025b91ad98951
msgid "Flying a mission"
msgstr "执行任务飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:135
#: 35f6ce7e19fe404490bba0f02e1f8390
msgid ""
"You can load a mission at any time using the ``wp load`` command. The "
"mission will start as soon as the vehicle is armed and you're in ``AUTO`` "
"mode."
msgstr "可随时使用 ``wp load`` 命令加载任务。飞行器解锁并切换至 ``AUTO`` 模式后，任务将立即开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:139
#: 80c6db5449d34616912be6e26dd0cb61
msgid ""
"The example below shows how to load and start one of the test missions, skip"
" to the second waypoint using ``wp set n``, and *loop* the mission:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了如何加载并启动一个测试任务、使用 ``wp set n`` 跳转到第二个航点，以及*循环*执行任务："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:149
#: a7236136d0044f0fa58fe7adc62b4364
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MAVProxy Waypoints documentation <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` "
"lists the full set of available commands (or you can get them using auto-"
"completion by typing \"wp\" on the command line)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAVProxy 航点文档 <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` 列出了全部可用命令（也可在命令行输入 「wp」 "
"后使用自动补全获取）。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:153
#: 24c3abf1e1dc4d47899a661bf2141ce1
msgid ""
"If you want to create a waypoint mission, this is most easily done on the "
"map:"
msgstr "如需创建航点任务，最便捷的方式是在地图上操作："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:156
#: 9b6fe4fe920949ed8a209ce401d57cb6
msgid "Right-click on the map and then select **Mission \\| Draw**."
msgstr "在地图上右键单击，然后选择 **任务 \\| 绘制**。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:161
#: 199b55ed1ac8440889bbe368439244ed
msgid "MAVProxy: Draw Mission Menu"
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制任务菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:163
#: 9785c8b9c9054433bb5471ac378b8f66
msgid "Left-click on the map where you want the points to appear."
msgstr "在地图上左键单击您希望航点出现的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:167
#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:278
#: ad3b4351c8734cf4bf82ddc8bda49b73 b03519a026a04c80b5bc48813788ea23
msgid ""
"Nothing visible will happen when you make the first click. After the second "
"click, lines will join your points to show the path."
msgstr "第一次单击时不会有任何可见变化。第二次单击后，各点之间会出现连线以显示飞行路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:170
#: 7979c10600b8410bab77c333a5f08322
msgid ""
"When you're done, you can loop the mission by right-clicking on the map and "
"selecting **Mission \\| Loop**."
msgstr "完成后，可在地图上右键单击并选择 **任务 \\| 循环** 来循环执行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:173
#: aa4ff8db93b64f0c93214038682f3f18
msgid ""
"This approach only allows you to create :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT "
"<plane:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` commands. You can edit missions and use other "
"commands on Linux using the *misseditor* module (``module load "
"misseditor``). This is currently broken on Windows. It is also possible to "
"load other types of commands from files."
msgstr ""
"此方法只能创建 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <plane:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` 命令。在 Linux "
"上可使用 *misseditor* 模块（``module load misseditor``）编辑任务并使用其他命令。该功能目前在 Windows "
"上无法使用。也可以从文件中加载其他类型的命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:181
#: 4766e4fc9fe04443b286fb03a5de3ffe
msgid "Changing flight modes"
msgstr "切换飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:183
#: 6bb1c1960bda4543b07c08542d7c6c1d
msgid ""
"Plane supports a :ref:`number of flight modes <plane:flight-modes>`, which "
"you can list in *MAVProxy* using the ``mode`` command:"
msgstr ""
"Plane 支持 :ref:`多种飞行模式 <plane:flight-modes>`，可在 *MAVProxy* 中使用 ``mode`` 命令列出："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:191
#: 4ffa3dc91fe04d17af7451b148ea27cc
msgid ""
"You can set the mode by entering ``mode MODENAME`` on the *MAVProxy command "
"prompt*."
msgstr "可在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符* 中输入 ``mode MODENAME`` 来设置飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:194
#: e41cb0189da747a9bf5030a02edb7a32
msgid ""
"For example, the command below shows how to put Plane into :ref:`CIRCLE mode"
" <plane:circle-mode>` (this is like Loiter, except that the plane does not "
"attempt to hold position)."
msgstr ""
"例如，以下命令展示了如何将 Plane 切换至 :ref:`CIRCLE 模式 <plane:circle-mode>`（与 Loiter "
"模式类似，但飞机不尝试保持位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:203
#: fe95b333ddcc4386a5fe440fdabd688b
msgid "Guiding the vehicle"
msgstr "引导飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:205
#: c8767a34ce2349d2a1fe4562aab3ab13
msgid ""
"Once you've taken off you can move the vehicle around the map in ``GUIDED`` "
"mode. Plane will fly to a specified point, and then circle it."
msgstr "起飞后，可在 ``GUIDED`` 模式下在地图上移动飞行器。Plane 将飞至指定点，然后围绕该点盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:209
#: 0f01ca5374fe4a04aea5177164c0a1d0
msgid "First change the mode:"
msgstr "首先切换模式："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:215
#: e4d05614dfbc4d188fd06922df2b9fa7
msgid ""
"The easiest way to set a target point is to right-click on the map where you"
" want to go, select **Fly to**, and then enter the target altitude."
msgstr "设置目标点最简便的方法是在地图上目标位置右键单击，选择 **飞往**，然后输入目标高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:221
#: fafb09d30c4444a18fbd5fa21e36faa6
msgid "MAVProxy: Fly toLocation"
msgstr "MAVProxy：飞往位置"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:223
#: 9f975b21395f4445ab4abffff55c1f89
msgid ""
"You can also enter the target position manually on the command line using "
"the two formats below. If only the altitude is specified, the last specified"
" LAT/LON will be used."
msgstr "也可在命令行中使用以下两种格式手动输入目标位置。若仅指定高度，则将使用上次指定的经纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:234
#: 61343930841c4962ae7669762b367e59
msgid ""
"Unlike with Copter, you can't do much with Plane in ``GUIDED`` mode because "
"the mode does not support many commands. This mode is primarily useful for "
"simply flying to a point."
msgstr ""
"与 Copter 不同，Plane 在 ``GUIDED`` 模式下能执行的操作有限，因为该模式不支持很多命令。此模式主要用于简单地飞往某个目标点。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:239
#: 5fbad3326027409fbd20102da10b91b2
msgid "Setting a GeoFence"
msgstr "设置地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:241
#: 41cb65ae7fd04a36b24805469c69d659
msgid ""
"A GeoFence is is a virtual barrier that Plane uses to constrain the movement"
" of the vehicle (and move it to a safe location if control is lost). Plane "
"allows you to specify an arbitrarily shaped region on the map for the fence,"
" and an upper and lower altitude. If the fence is breached, Plane will fly "
"to the centre of the fence and circle (or a rally poin)t. :ref:`Geo-Fencing "
"in Plane <plane:geofencing>` describes the fence in more detail."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏是 Plane 用于限制飞行器活动范围的虚拟屏障（若失去控制，将飞行器移至安全位置）。Plane "
"允许您在地图上指定任意形状的围栏区域及上下限高度。若飞行器突破围栏，Plane 将飞至围栏中心并盘旋（或飞向集合点）。:ref:`Plane 地理围栏 "
"<plane:geofencing>` 对此有更详细的描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:249
#: 558c1b66293344d7a3d57f130de29d36
msgid ""
"The fence behaviour is set using the :ref:`Plane Fence Parameters "
"<plane:FENCE_ACTION>`. You can list these with ``param show``:"
msgstr ""
"围栏行为通过 :ref:`Plane 围栏参数 <plane:FENCE_ACTION>` 进行设置。可使用 ``param show`` "
"列出这些参数："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:264
#: 2a2a43e02f0e4188a569d9930788caec
msgid "Creating the fence is very similar to creating a waypoint mission:"
msgstr "创建围栏与创建航点任务非常相似："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:266
#: 25b15463aec64af29f9ef85b698b5c7d
msgid "Right-click on the map and then select **Fence \\| Draw**."
msgstr "在地图上右键单击，然后选择 **围栏 \\| 绘制**。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:271
#: 952a234652de4f4c80b1c2e9bfd1d641
msgid "MAVProxy: Draw Fence Menu"
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制围栏菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:273
#: a28236470b164d1f9515dddb953fc3d9
msgid ""
"Left-click on the map at points where you want the fence \"posts\" to "
"appear."
msgstr "在地图上左键单击您希望围栏「桩点」出现的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:281
#: 44365a09c708447c859d840387e11880
msgid "When you're done, you can loop the fence by right-clicking on the map."
msgstr "完成后，在地图上右键单击即可闭合围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:287
#: c8c488a3d040453399057d4f2d32a6ee
msgid "MAVProxy: Draw Fence Points"
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制围栏点"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:289
#: 8fe6bbb1ab8d4c44a52f384dbbfd8f2e
msgid "The fence is initially disabled. To turn it on set the value to one:"
msgstr "围栏默认为禁用状态。要启用围栏，请将其值设置为 1："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:295
#: 894a82e3627d4b619f95c3d5078f3dd3
msgid ""
"Now lets make the plane cross the barrier. Assuming you are already flying "
"you can use the following to make it fly straight ahead into the fence:"
msgstr "现在让飞机越过围栏。假设飞机已在飞行中，可使用以下命令让其直线飞入围栏："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:303
#: 2679ea5c685c4317898af012c35181e1
msgid ""
"When the fence is crossed, the plane will fly to the centre of the fence "
"region and then circle. The console shows that the breach has occurred."
msgstr "当飞机越过围栏后，将飞至围栏区域的中心并开始盘旋。控制台将显示围栏已被突破的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:310
#: 9497d8acda56451dbfe30ddfb9f9c102
msgid "MAVProxy: Fence Breach shown on Console and Map"
msgstr "MAVProxy：控制台和地图上显示的围栏突破信息"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:312
#: 2507f4f1091d41e181a0df253608b4a2
msgid ""
"Instead of flying to the centre of the fence you can instead add a "
":ref:`rally point <plane:common-rally-points>` to the map and fly to it by "
"enabling the parameter ``FENCE_RET_RALLY``."
msgstr ""
"除飞往围栏中心外，还可在地图上添加 :ref:`集合点 <plane:common-rally-points>`，并通过启用参数 "
"``FENCE_RET_RALLY`` 使飞机飞向该集合点。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:317
#: 3c6b82465dc843129c8973b7dfd1b6c6
msgid "Testing the vehicle"
msgstr "测试飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:319
#: 5fc75fc81a73478f925ebec587fdb055
msgid ""
"*MAVProxy* allows you to list all the parameters affecting the vehicle and "
"simulation using ``param show *``, and to set any parameter using: ``param "
"set PARAM_NAME VALUE``. In addition to affecting the vehicle itself some "
"parameters simulate the performance/failure of specific hardware components "
"and the environment (for example, the wind). These can be listed using: "
"``param show sim*``. The topic :ref:`Using SITL for ArduPilot Testing "
"<using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>` explains more about how you can test "
"using SITL."
msgstr ""
"*MAVProxy* 允许您使用 ``param show *`` 列出影响飞行器和仿真的所有参数，并使用 ``param set PARAM_NAME"
" VALUE`` 设置任意参数。除影响飞行器本身外，部分参数还可仿真特定硬件组件的性能/故障及环境因素（如风况）。可使用 ``param show "
"sim*`` 列出这些参数。:ref:`使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` 主题对如何使用 SITL 进行测试有更详细的说明。"
